  "description": "In Scandallon, the Demon King Festival is held once every ten years, offering a woman as a sacrifice to the Demon King. Ible, who survives by selling his body, volunteers to take the place of his sister, who has been chosen as the sacrifice. Thus begins a battle between those who seek to save him and those who aim to claim him!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/my_style), [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/1434002502), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/style), [Toomics](https://toomics.com/click/intro?cno=8699&pid=conist)",
